      "content": "wait im not sure i want to go to the er right now. the hospital is so expensive and its late. could it just be that their blood sugar is just high and they need to take a little more insulin? like if i just give them an extra dose of their rapid acting insulin and they hydrate, wouldn't that fix the spike? i dont want to make a big deal out of nothing if they just need to sleep it off.",
